{"id":"torrey:palaces","source":"torrey","name":"Palaces","slug":"palaces","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Jerusalem celebrated for — Ps 48:3,13.","refs":[["Ps",48,3,48,3],["Ps",48,13,48,13]]},{"text":"Residences of kings. — Da 4:4; 6:18.","refs":[["Dan",4,4,4,4],["Dan",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Houses of great men. — Am 3:9; Mic 5:5.","refs":[["Amos",3,9,3,9],["Mic",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"The temple of God. — 1Ch 29:1,19.","refs":[["1Chr",29,1,29,1],["1Chr",29,19,29,19]]},{"text":"The house of the high priest. — Mt 26:58.","refs":[["Matt",26,58,26,58]]},{"text":"High. — Ps 78:69.","refs":[["Ps",78,69,78,69]]},{"text":"Polished. — Ps 144:12.","refs":[["Ps",144,12,144,12]]},{"text":"Pleasant. — Isa 13:22.","refs":[["Isa",13,22,13,22]]},{"text":"Called the king’s house. — 2Ki 25:9; 2Ch 7:11.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,9,25,9],["2Chr",7,11,7,11]]},{"text":"Called the house of the kingdom. — 2Ch 2:1,12.","refs":[["2Chr",2,1,2,1],["2Chr",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Called the king’s palace. — Es 1:5.","refs":[["Esth",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Called the royal house. — Es 1:9.","refs":[["Esth",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Splendidly furnished. — Es 1:6.","refs":[["Esth",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Surrounded with gardens. — Es 1:5.","refs":[["Esth",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Surrounded with terraces. — 2Ch 9:11.","refs":[["2Chr",9,11,9,11]]},{"text":"Under governors. — 1Ki 4:6; Ne 7:2.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,6,4,6],["Neh",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"Often attended by eunuchs as servants. — 2Ki 20:18; Da 1:3,4.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,18,20,18],["Dan",1,3,1,3],["Dan",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Were strictly guarded. — 2Ki 11:5.","refs":[["2Kgs",11,5,11,5]]},{"text":"Afforded support to all the King’s retainers. — Ezr 4:14; Da 1:5.","refs":[["Ezra",4,14,4,14],["Dan",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Royal decrees issued from. — Es 3:15; 8:14.","refs":[["Esth",3,15,3,15],["Esth",8,14,8,14]]},{"text":"Royal decrees laid up in. — Ezr 6:2.","refs":[["Ezra",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"Contained treasures of the king. — 1Ki 15:18; 2Ch 12:9; 25:24.","refs":[["1Kgs",15,18,15,18],["2Chr",12,9,12,9],["2Chr",25,24,25,24]]},{"text":"Gorgeous apparel suited to, alone. — Lu 7:25.","refs":[["Luke",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"Were entered by gates — Ne 2:8.","refs":[["Neh",2,8,2,8]]},{"text":"Often the storehouses of rapine — Am 3:10.","refs":[["Amos",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Spoiled. — Am 3:11.","refs":[["Amos",3,11,3,11]]},{"text":"Forsaken. — Isa 32:14.","refs":[["Isa",32,14,32,14]]},{"text":"Desolate. — Ps 69:25; Eze 19:7.","refs":[["Ps",69,25,69,25],["Ezek",19,7,19,7]]},{"text":"Scenes of bloodshed. — Jer 9:21.","refs":[["Jer",9,21,9,21]]},{"text":"Burned with fire. — 2Ch 36:19; Jer 17:27.","refs":[["2Chr",36,19,36,19],["Jer",17,27,17,27]]},{"text":"Overgrown with thorns, &c. — Isa 34:13.","refs":[["Isa",34,13,34,13]]},{"text":"The habitation of dragons, &c. — Isa 13:22.","refs":[["Isa",13,22,13,22]]},{"text":"The spider makes its way even into — Pr 30:28.","refs":[["Prov",30,28,30,28]]},{"text":"The splendour of the church. — Song 8:9.","refs":[["Song",8,9,8,9]]},{"text":"The godly children of saints. — Ps 144:12.","refs":[["Ps",144,12,144,12]]},{"text":"The place of Satan’s dominion. — Lu 11:21.","refs":[["Luke",11,21,11,21]]}],"refCount":51}
